<title>UK: CRICKET-WORCESTERSHIRE V AUSTRALIA TOSS/TEAMS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WORCESTERSHIRE V AUSTRALIA TOSS/TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, England 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worcestershire won the toss and put Australia in to bat in their one-day match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Worcestershire - Phil Weston, Tom Moody (captain), Graeme Hick, Gavin Haynes, Karl Spiring, Vikram Solanki, Davikd Leatherdale, Steve Rhodes, Phil Newport, Alamgir Sheriyar, Stuart Lampitt.</p>
<p>Australia - Mark Taylor (captain), Adam Gilchrist, Steve Waugh, Michael Bevan, Greg Blewett, Jason Langer, Ian Healy, Shane Warne, Brendon Julian, Michael Kasprowicz, Glenn McGrath.</p>
